# Basic LAN Setup – Star Topology

## Objective
Build a simple LAN using a switch and 5 PCs with static IPs
and verify connectivity using ping.

## Tools Used
- Cisco Packet Tracer

##  Topology
- 1 × Cisco 2960 Switch
- 5 × PCs connected via Copper Straight-Through cables

##  IP Address Table
| Device | IP Address     | Subnet Mask     |
|--------|----------------|-----------------|
| PC0    | 10.0.0.1       | 255.255.255.0   |
| PC1    | 10.0.0.2       | 255.255.255.0   |
| PC2    | 10.0.0.3       | 255.255.255.0   |
| PC3    | 10.0.0.4       | 255.255.255.0   |
| PC4    | 10.0.0.5       | 255.255.255.0   |

## Verification
- Pinged all PCs from PC0 — all replies successful
- PDU test between PC0 and PC4 — Successful

